---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const evidenceHref = '/research/seed-openevo/evidence/q17-advisor-diagnostics-20260911.json';
const sourceHref = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/38223bf7f07aa2c2978c8583bcfb12097e9ee052/docs/evidence/q17-advisor-diagnostics-20260911/README.md';
const replicationHref = 'https://github.com/mykcs/openevo-experiment/blob/f6fa4d05b7433685088ac59b1b488eecb42c781e/docs/evidence/q17-advisor-diagnostics-20260911/gpu2-replication-20260911/README.md';

const rows = [
  [t('WebShop 平均分', 'Mean WebShop score'), '63.58', '59.41', '−4.18', t('95% CI：−17.13 ～ +8.00', '95% CI: −17.13 to +8.00')],
  [t('真正完成任务', 'Exact success'), '31.25%', '25.00%', '−6.25 pp', t('95% CI：−18.75 ～ +6.25 pp', '95% CI: −18.75 to +6.25 pp')],
  [t('拿到正奖励', 'Positive reward'), '84.38%', '78.13%', '−6.25 pp', ''],
  [t('平均环境步数', 'Mean environment steps'), '7.41', '7.53', '+0.13', ''],
  [t('每步输出 token', 'Output tokens / step'), '24.49', '24.95', '+0.47', ''],
  [t('推理阶段 entropy', 'Reasoning entropy'), '0.392', '0.343', '−0.050', t('nats / token；越低表示当前解码分布更集中', 'nats / token; lower means a more concentrated decoding distribution')],
] as const;
---

<section class="advisor-diagnostics" data-q17-advisor-diagnostics data-reader-primary aria-labelledby="advisor-diagnostics-title">
  <header class="result-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">2026-09-11 · {t('固定同题诊断', 'Same-task diagnostic')}</p>
    <h1 id="advisor-diagnostics-title">{t('R127 到 R128：有些能力换了位置，但还不能说整体发生了遗忘', 'R127 to R128: some capabilities moved, but the evidence does not show overall forgetting')}</h1>
    <p class="lede">{t('我们把两个 checkpoint 放到完全相同的 32 道 WebShop 题上。平均分从 63.58 降到 59.41，成功率从 31.25% 降到 25.00%；3 道原本成功的题变成失败，1 道原本失败的题变成成功。两项主要差值的 95% 置信区间都跨过 0，所以目前能确认的是“任务能力发生了重排，并伴随小幅下滑”，还不能把它写成“整体显著遗忘”。', 'We evaluated both checkpoints on the same 32 WebShop tasks. Mean score fell from 63.58 to 59.41 and exact success from 31.25% to 25.00%; three previously solved tasks became failures while one previously failed task became a success. Both primary 95% confidence intervals cross zero, so the supported claim is task-level capability reallocation with a modest downward shift—not statistically clear overall forgetting.')}</p>
    <div class="evidence-links" aria-label={t('诊断证据', 'Diagnostic evidence')}>
      <a href={evidenceHref}>{t('网站证据摘要', 'Site evidence summary')}</a>
      <a href={sourceHref}><ExternalBrandMark href={sourceHref} />{t('实验仓完整证据', 'Full experiment evidence')}</a>
      <a href={replicationHref}><ExternalBrandMark href={replicationHref} />{t('GPU2 独立复现', 'Independent GPU2 replication')}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="result-section" aria-labelledby="same-task-result">
    <h2 id="same-task-result">{t('同样 32 道题，变化比训练 round 的 76.1 → 48.9 小得多', 'On the same 32 tasks, the change is much smaller than the live-round 76.1 → 48.9 swing')}</h2>
    <p>{t('训练过程里的每一轮并不是同一套题，所以 round score 同时混入了任务抽样难度。固定同题之后仍能看到 R128 略差，但差距明显缩小：这说明原来的大幅回撤不能直接等同于模型突然失去同样比例的能力。', 'Training rounds do not contain the same task sample, so live round score mixes model change with task difficulty. The fixed-task test still trends downward at R128, but the gap is much smaller. The large live-round drop therefore cannot be treated as an equally large loss of model capability.')}</p>

    <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label={t('R127 与 R128 固定同题指标', 'R127 versus R128 fixed-task metrics')} tabindex="0">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th>{t('指标', 'Metric')}</th><th>R127</th><th>R128</th><th>{t('变化', 'Change')}</th><th>{t('统计 / 说明', 'Uncertainty / note')}</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>{rows.map(([label, left, right, delta, note]) => <tr><th scope="row">{label}</th><td>{left}</td><td>{right}</td><td>{delta}</td><td>{note || '—'}</td></tr>)}</tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <dl class="transition-line">
      <div><dt>{t('两边都成功', 'Solved by both')}</dt><dd>7</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('成功 → 失败', 'Success → failure')}</dt><dd>3</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('失败 → 成功', 'Failure → success')}</dt><dd>1</dd></div>
      <div><dt>{t('两边都失败', 'Failed by both')}</dt><dd>21</dd></div>
    </dl>
  </section>

  <section class="result-section reasoning" aria-labelledby="what-it-means">
    <h2 id="what-it-means">{t('2026-09-11 固定同题诊断削弱了两个过早的解释', 'The diagnostic weakens two premature explanations')}</h2>
    <div class="reasoning-line">
      <article>
        <h3>{t('不是一个明显的接口故障', 'Not an obvious interface failure')}</h3>
        <p>{t('两个 checkpoint 的 32 题诊断都没有 invalid action 或 constraint escape。正式 R127 / R128 日志里对应的 invalid、repair、constraint-escape 也都是 0。掉分不能先归因给 parser 或动作接口坏了。', 'Neither 32-task checkpoint run produced invalid actions or constraint escapes; the corresponding formal R127/R128 logs also recorded zero invalid, repair, and constraint-escape events. The drop should not be attributed first to a broken parser or action interface.')}</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h3>{t('也不是“模型突然更迷茫”', 'Nor did the model simply become more uncertain')}</h3>
        <p>{t('推理阶段 entropy 从 0.392 降到 0.343 nats/token，受动作约束后的 entropy 也从 0.0238 降到 0.0167。R128 的解码反而更集中一些；这更像策略偏好发生变化，而不是整体不确定性突然上升。', 'Reasoning entropy fell from 0.392 to 0.343 nats/token, and constrained-action entropy fell from 0.0238 to 0.0167. Decoding became somewhat more concentrated at R128, pointing toward a policy-preference shift rather than a sudden rise in global uncertainty.')}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <aside class="claim-boundary">
      <strong>{t('现在还不能证明：', 'Still not established:')}</strong>
      <p>{t('这 32 题不足以证明整体发生了显著遗忘，也不足以证明某个负的 update cosine 就是原因。把 R127 写进 R128 的那次 SD-LoRA 更新，adjacent cosine 是 −0.135；但 R120–R134 之间还有更负的更新，所以它目前只是需要继续检查的线索。', 'These 32 tasks do not establish statistically clear overall forgetting, and they do not establish a negative update cosine as the cause. The SD-LoRA update that produced the R128 entering state had adjacent cosine −0.135, but more negative updates also occurred between R120 and R134. It remains a clue, not a causal result.')}</p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="result-section" aria-labelledby="next-question">
    <h2 id="next-question">{t('下一步：把“会不会互相冲掉”变成可重复的同题测量', 'Next: turn possible interference into a repeatable same-task measurement')}</h2>
    <p>{t('当前 R1–R160 正式训练继续按冻结设置运行，不因为 2026-09-11 这组固定同题诊断改 learning rate、replay、prompt、sampling 或 SD-LoRA 规则。等更多 checkpoint 和 R160 可用后，再用同一批题看“哪些能力获得、哪些能力丢失”是否持续出现；只有这种现象稳定复现，才值得设计 retention / replay / update-conflict 的后继实验。', 'The formal R1–R160 run continues under the frozen treatment. This diagnostic does not change learning rate, replay, prompt, sampling, or SD-LoRA rules. When more checkpoints and R160 become available, the same panel can test whether gains and losses recur. Only a repeatable pattern would justify successor interventions for retention, replay, or update conflict.')}</p>
  </section>

  <details class="method-depth">
    <summary>{t('诊断是怎么做的，以及它不是什么', 'How the diagnostic was run—and what it is not')}</summary>
    <div class="method-grid">
      <div><strong>{t('固定题目', 'Fixed tasks')}</strong><p>{t('32 个任务来自诊断用 train/dev 范围；在看 R127 / R128 对比结果前就冻结。它们与锁定 final 128 的 goal / instruction overlap 都是 0。', 'The 32 diagnostic train/dev tasks were frozen before inspecting the R127/R128 result. Their goal and instruction overlap with the locked final 128 is zero.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('固定其他条件', 'Matched conditions')}</strong><p>{t('两边使用相同任务、generation seed、Harness201.1、Text Memory、Skill 和 Agent System。变化的是进入 R127 与进入 R128 的 SD-LoRA adapter。', 'Both checkpoints use identical tasks, generation seeds, Harness201.1, Text Memory, Skill, and Agent System. The changed factor is the SD-LoRA adapter entering R127 versus R128.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('Entropy 的含义', 'What entropy means here')}</strong><p>{t('这里是实际解码过程在当前 logits processor / action constraint 之后的 operational decoding entropy，不是“完全无约束模型”的原始 entropy。4 题 OFF/ON 资格测试证明加入观测后输出、动作和得分 4/4 完全一致。', 'This is operational decoding entropy after the active logits processors and action constraint, not unconstrained raw-model entropy. A four-task OFF/ON qualification reproduced output, actions, and scores exactly 4/4 after instrumentation was added.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('没有碰最终测试', 'Final evaluation stayed locked')}</strong><p>{t('final-panel access = 0，formal task consumption = 0，external teacher calls = 0。这个页面是实验仓证据的只读投影，不能授权修改正式 run 或打开 final panel。', 'Final-panel access = 0, formal task consumption = 0, and external teacher calls = 0. This page is a read-only projection of experiment evidence and cannot authorize formal-run changes or final-panel access.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('独立复现', 'Independent replication')}</strong><p>{t('同一套 32 题后来又在服务器 GPU2 上完整重跑。两个 checkpoint 的 32 个 task rows、paired rows 和主要 comparison fields 与原 GPU0 证据完全一致。这个结果增强的是可复现性，不会把跨 0 的置信区间变成“显著遗忘”。', 'The same 32-task diagnostic was later rerun independently on server GPU2. Both 32-task row sets, all paired rows, and every authoritative comparison field exactly match the original GPU0 evidence. This strengthens reproducibility; it does not turn confidence intervals that cross zero into statistically clear forgetting.')}</p></div>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<style>
.advisor-diagnostics{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:0 auto 4rem;color:var(--ink)}
.result-hero{padding:4.5rem 0 2.4rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.eyebrow{margin:0 0 .8rem;font:800 18px/1.25 var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--accent-deep)}
.result-hero h1{max-width:980px;margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5.5vw,4.8rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.065em}
.lede{max-width:900px;margin:1.25rem 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:1.12rem;line-height:1.68}
.evidence-links{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.55rem;margin-top:1.3rem}.evidence-links a{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:.35rem 0;color:var(--accent-deep);text-decoration:none;margin-right:1rem}
.result-section{padding:2.8rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.result-section h2{max-width:900px;margin:0 0 1rem;font-size:clamp(1.65rem,3.2vw,2.8rem);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em}.result-section>p,.reasoning-line p,.claim-boundary p,.method-grid p{max-width:900px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}
.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:1.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:760px}th,td{padding:.85rem .7rem;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--line) 75%,transparent);vertical-align:top}thead th{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.04em}tbody th{font-weight:700}td:nth-child(2),td:nth-child(3),td:nth-child(4){font-family:var(--font-mono);font-weight:700}
.transition-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin:1.5rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.transition-line div{padding:1rem;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.transition-line div:last-child{border-right:0}.transition-line dt{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem}.transition-line dd{margin:.3rem 0 0;font:850 1.8rem/1 var(--font-mono)}
.reasoning-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:2rem;margin-top:1.5rem}.reasoning-line article{padding-top:1rem;border-top:2px solid var(--accent-deep)}.reasoning-line h3{margin:0;font-size:1.25rem}.claim-boundary{margin-top:1.8rem;padding:1rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--warning)}.claim-boundary strong{font-size:1.05rem}.claim-boundary p{margin:.55rem 0 0}
.method-depth{margin-top:2rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:1rem 0}.method-depth summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:750;color:var(--accent-deep)}.method-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.2rem 2rem;padding:1.2rem 0 .4rem}.method-grid p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.94rem}
@media(max-width:820px){.result-hero{padding-top:2.6rem}.reasoning-line,.method-grid,.transition-line{grid-template-columns:1fr}.transition-line div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.transition-line div:last-child{border-bottom:0}}
</style>
